cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PhiPack, please cite the original publication below. This
  repository is an unofficial archival mirror of the software; the science and
  the software are the work of the authors listed.
title: "PhiPack: PHI test and other tests of recombination"
abstract: >-
  PhiPack implements the Pairwise Homoplasy Index (PHI), Maximum Chi-Squared and
  the Neighbour Similarity Score (NSS) for detecting the presence of
  recombination in aligned sequence data. The Phi program tests an alignment as
  a whole; the Profile program scans a sliding window along an alignment to
  locate the regions with the strongest evidence of recombination.
type: software
